  "buildNotes": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 960,
   "page": "customer",
   "text": "Build notes\n\n• Page shell: min-h-dvh (100dvh), never 100vh.\n• Launcher: fixed right-4 bottom-[calc(1rem+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))]; right-6 bottom-6 on desktop.\n• Desktop panel: fixed, 400×600 (max-h: calc(100dvh-3rem)), shadow-lg, rounded-xl.\n• Mobile (<640px): fixed inset-0 h-dvh sheet; pad with env(safe-area-inset-*). Needs viewport-fit=cover in the viewport meta.\n• Esc closes; focus returns to the launcher (or the order's help link).\n• 'Get help with this order' opens the widget with that order preselected; a new order starts a new thread.\n• Thread is role=log aria-live=polite; verdict cards are <article> with the ref ID in the header.\n• Composer: 16px font on mobile so iOS doesn't zoom; soft 500-char limit.\n• Verdict card renders badge + ref first; explanation streams (aria-busy on the card until done, so screen readers get it once).\n• Automatic-review failure → normal Escalated card; never an error to the customer.\n• Items with an active or completed refund are marked and not selectable; markers link to Your requests.",
